🚀 IPLytics — Real-Time IPL Analytics Dashboard
<p align="center"> <b>Full-Stack Cricket Analytics Platform with Live Data + Historical Insights</b><br/> Built with Spring Boot, React, and Real IPL Data (2008–2024) </p>
🌐 Live Preview (Optional)

