✨ Features
📊 Historical Analytics
IPL data from 2008–2024
Season-wise performance insights
Points table with Net Run Rate
Team match history & head-to-head stats
Match-level details with results & highlights
⚡ Live Match System
Real-time match updates using external API
Auto-refresh every 5 seconds
Smart fallback → shows recent matches if no live match
Clean UI with LIVE badge 🔴
📈 Interactive Visualizations
Performance charts (Recharts)
Venue-based insights
Modern UI with animations (Framer Motion)
🏗️ Architecture
Frontend (React)
       ↓
REST API (Spring Boot)
       ↓
Service Layer (Business Logic)
       ↓
Repository Layer (JPA)
       ↓
Database / CSV Dataset
🛠️ Tech Stack
🔹 Backend
Java (Spring Boot)
REST API Design
JPA / Hibernate
Maven
🔹 Frontend
React.js
Tailwind CSS
Recharts
Framer Motion
🔹 Data
IPL Dataset (CSV)
OpenCSV Parser
External API (CricAPI)
