⚙️ Setup Guide
🔹 Clone Repo
git clone https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/IPLytics.git
cd IPLytics
🔹 Backend Setup
cd ipl-backend
mvn clean install
mvn spring-boot:run

Backend runs at:

http://localhost:8080
🔹 Frontend Setup
cd frontend
npm install
npm run dev

Frontend runs at:

http://localhost:5173
📂 Dataset Setup (IMPORTANT)

⚠️ Dataset files are excluded (large size)

👉 Download IPL dataset and place inside:

ipl-backend/src/main/resources/data/

Required:

matches.csv
deliveries.csv
🔌 API Endpoints
Endpoint	Description
/api/years	IPL seasons
/api/seasons	Season summaries
/api/points-table/{year}	Points table
/api/team-matches/{team}/{year}	Team matches
/api/match/{id}	Match details
/api/head-to-head	Team comparison
/api/live-matches	Live matches
/api/predict	Match prediction
🧠 Backend Engineering Highlights
Layered architecture (Controller → Service → Repository)
Efficient CSV parsing & bulk data loading
REST API design for scalable data delivery
External API integration with fallback handling
Clean, modular, and maintainable code
🎯 Key Learnings
Designing scalable backend systems
Handling real-world datasets
API integration and error handling
Debugging production-level issues
Writing clean and structured code
